        "html": "<p><strong>The confetti is still in the carpet.</strong> Dance floor at midnight, toasts that ran long, a photo booth that never got a break — every frame is here, edited and ready to share.</p><p><em>Grab your favorites, tag the crew, and relive it on loop.</em></p>",
